    "parsed_response": {
      "turns": [
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "Good morning, Mr Tan. Michelle Koh speaking. Thanks for calling. Have you got a quiet moment to talk?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "Morning, Michelle. Yes, I'm in my office with the door closed. Telephone appointments suit me better than coming down, especially when the business schedule keeps changing."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "Certainly. We can keep the conversation focused. Let me start with your identification details, please."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "I've got my notebook beside me. [[EV_016]] [[EV_017]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "Thank you. Take your time with the paperwork; there's no need to rush through it."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "[[EV_018]] Let me get the official document from my drawer as well."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "Of course. Do you usually set aside a regular slot for personal administration, or fit it between your business appointments?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "Mostly between appointments, which is why my paperwork gets a bit scattered. Ah, here it is. [[EV_019]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "Thank you for checking. We can move on to the main purpose of your call now."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "[[EV_013]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "Before we go further, I'll cover the relevant points on your file. [[EV_001]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "[[EV_014]] Give me a moment to collect my thoughts."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "Take your time. [[EV_002]] [[EV_004]] [[EV_003]] [[EV_005]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "[[EV_006]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "[[EV_010]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "Please keep my own wording in the record, Michelle. [[EV_011]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "[[EV_012]] [[EV_007]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "[[EV_015]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "[[EV_008]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "[[EV_009]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "Thank you. For future telephone appointments, would you prefer that I arrange them directly with you rather than through your office?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "Directly with me, please. My staff can help organise the paperwork, but I prefer to handle these calls myself. Late morning is usually easier."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "I'll note that scheduling preference. Thanks for making time today, Mr Tan. I'll let you get back to your business."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "Thanks, Michelle. That works for me. Goodbye."
        }
      ]
